{'symbol': 'AMZN', 'date': '2022-09-07 16:28:00', 'title': 'IROBOT INVESTOR ALERT BY THE FORMER ATTORNEY GENERAL OF LOUISIANA: KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC INVESTIGATES ADEQUACY OF PRICE AND PROCESS IN PROPOSED SALE OF IROBOT CORPORATION - IRBT', 'text': 'NEW ORLEANS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FORMER ATTORNEY GENERAL OF LOUISIANA CHARLES C. FOTI, JR., ESQ. AND THE LAW FIRM OF KAHN SWICK & FOTI, LLC (“KSF”) ARE INVESTIGATING THE PROPOSED SALE OF IROBOT CORPORATION (NASDAQGS: IRBT) TO AMAZON.COM, INC. (NASDAQGS: AMZN). UNDER THE TERMS OF THE PROPOSED TRANSACTION, SHAREHOLDERS OF IROBOT WILL RECEIVE $61.00 IN CASH FOR EACH SHARE OF IROBOT THAT THEY OWN. KSF IS SEEKING TO DETERMINE WHETHER THIS CONSIDERATION AND THE PROCESS THAT LED TO IT ARE ADEQUATE, O'}